+     * Extra execution latency, in cycles, that a timing CPU adds after
+     * completing an instruction, before it starts fetching the next one
+     * (TimingSimpleCPU::advanceInst).  The default is zero: an ISA that does
+     * not model per-instruction execution latency keeps the upstream
+     * behaviour bit for bit.
